  "title": "Caitlin O NDE",
  "date": "2025-03-21T12:05:30.000Z",
  "content": "I was age 14 and my boyfriend was age 18. <br><br> He assaulted my best friend and then his mother. He went to jail. When he got out, I broke up with him because I was very scared of him. <br><br> He came to my house at about three in the morning. After being hit in the head the first time, I felt as though I had slipped out of my body and shot 30 feet in the air. I watched from above the street light as he beat me for 10 more minutes. I did not feel pleasant or distressed. I actually felt very present and remember consciously thinking “This is unfortunate that this had to happened.” <br><br><span class=\"m108",
